r 7 7 2 step 1 shape (11, 11) sum 72 nxtsum 24 ncomps 1\nhwr 7 7 2 step 2 shape (11, 11) sum 24 nxtsum 0 ncomps 0\nstop crop shape (7, 7) sum 24 equals original? True\nhwr 9 9 1 step 0 shape (11, 11) sum 96 nxtsum 32 ncomps 1\nhwr 9 9 1 step 1 shape (11, 11) sum 32 nxtsum 0 ncomps 0\nstop crop shape (9, 9) sum 32 equals original? True\nhwr 9 9 2 step 0 shape (13, 13) sum 160 nxtsum 96 ncomps 1\nhwr 9 9 2 step 1 shape (13, 13) sum 96 nxtsum 32 ncomps 1\nhwr 9 9 2 step 2 shape (13, 13) sum 32 nxtsum 0 ncomps 0\nstop crop shape (9, 9) sum 32 equals original? True\nhwr 11 13 1 step 0 shape (13, 15) sum 132 nxtsum 44 ncomps 1\nhwr 11 13 1 step 1 shape (13, 15) sum 44 nxtsum 0 ncomps 0\nstop crop shape (11, 13) sum 44 equals original? True\nhwr 11 13 2 step 0 shape (15, 17) sum 220 nxtsum 132 ncomps 1\nhwr 11 13 2 step 1 shape (15, 17) sum 132 nxtsum 44 ncomps 1\nhwr 11 13 2 step 2 shape (15, 17) sum 44 nxtsum 0 ncomps 0\nstop crop shape (11, 13) sum 44 equals original? True\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
